# Streamclone Pulse backend guardrails

Cursor-specific. Generic routing: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md). Extension/portal repo: sibling **streamclone-pulse**.

## Read docs before code

Before changing coverage, backfill, extension BFF, portal analytics, or hosted pulse env:

- [`../streamclone-pulse/docs/pulse-extension/live-coverage-requirements.md`](../streamclone-pulse/docs/pulse-extension/live-coverage-requirements.md)
- [`../streamclone-pulse/docs/website-portal/design.md`](../streamclone-pulse/docs/website-portal/design.md)
- [`../streamclone-pulse/docs/website-portal/tasks.md`](../streamclone-pulse/docs/website-portal/tasks.md)

Also read `.kiro/steering/analytics.md` for sync/rollup context.

## Guardrails (non-negotiable)

- No unauthenticated `/watch`
- No raw chat exposed to extension or portal
- No client-side Pulse scoring
- No fake progress in API payloads (coverage/backfill states must be honest)
- No full timeline fetch on live polling endpoints
- Backend coverage, peaks, sync, and backfill are source of truth
- D1 is user state only — never rollups, raw chat, VOD chat, TwitchTracker, or corpus data

## Key paths

- BFF: `internal/analytics/extension_api.go`, `pulse_coverage.go`, `pulse_backfill*.go`, `pulse_hosted.go`
- Shared types: `packages/pulse-core/`
- Hosted: `deploy/env/profile-bearhost-pulse.env`, `PULSE_BETA_KEYS` (never commit)

Cursor skills/subagents for Pulse work live in **streamclone-pulse** `.cursor/`; backend subagents also in this repo `.cursor/agents/`.
